.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Runs 1000 one-sample t-tests, 100 of which have a real effect. With no correction, dozens of the &quot;discoveries&quot; are false; Bonferroni avoids false discoveries but misses most real effects; Benjamini-Hochberg keeps the fraction of false discoveries near the chosen 5% while finding far more of the real ones.">

